        "`TRAINABLE_LAYERS_OVERRIDE = 1`. Change nothing else.\n"
        "3. **Run:** select that cell and choose **Runtime → Run after**. It reloads the pretrained model before "
        "adapting, Section 8 adds an *exploratory* row to the run history, and Section 9 exports and reloads the new "
